# Bitwarden Secrets Manager: required secret names for OpenStats on podman01.
#
# Create these secrets in your BWS project with the EXACT names shown below.
# The bws CLI (via `bws run`) injects secrets using their name as the env var key.
#
# Secret name (in BWS)    Value to set
# ─────────────────────   ─────────────────────────────────────
# POSTGRES_PASSWORD        random strong password (e.g., 32 hex chars)
# GRAFANA_PASSWORD         random strong password for the OpenLabStats Grafana admin
